 All existing asset, theme, collection, manifest and byte limits still apply to the combined workspace. An import that exceeds them fails before staging; it never drops old revisions to make room. Atomic transitions may append a contiguous batch of immutable revisions, but cannot skip a new revision, duplicate an identity or rewrite a retained record. This matches the local store's saved-history checks.
 
